  "messages": [
    "Call the Agent tool exactly once, with subagent_type \"general-purpose\", and give the subagent this task word for word: 'Read the file chain/start.txt with the Read tool. Each file of the chain names the next file. Follow the chain with one Read call per response, never two in one response, until a file gives the final word. Report the final word.' Do not read any file yourself. Answer with the word the subagent reports."
